AppNeta Intelligent Alarm ({S 304}) - {S 306} on item {S 308}

SYMPTOMS:

An AppNeta Intelligent Alarms MultipleDnsErrors rule was triggered, indicating repeated DNS
resolution failures across multiple attempts for the monitored target.

PROBABLE CAUSES:

DNS server unavailability, misconfigured resolvers, or a failing authoritative name server
for the monitored target's domain, as determined by AppNeta's own monitoring criteria for
this rule.

RECOMMENDED ACTIONS:

Review this alarm's details in AppNeta's Intelligent Alarms console to determine root cause.
This alarm clears automatically when AppNeta reports the underlying condition resolved.
